MaterialLexer: DISSOLVE and EMISSIVE_LIGHTING are different tokens: true
MaterialLexer: a d line starts with DISSOLVE, not EMISSIVE_LIGHTING: true
d 0.5 alone: dissolve set true (0.5), emissive set false, specular set false
Ke 0.25 0.5 0.75 alone: dissolve set false, emissive set true (0.25 0.5 0.75), specular set false
Ke, then d: dissolve set true (0.5), emissive set true (0.25 0.5 0.75), specular set false
d, then Ke: dissolve set true (0.5), emissive set true (0.25 0.5 0.75), specular set false
Ks, then Ke: specular 0.1 0.2 0.3, emissive 0.25 0.5 0.75
Material:SetHasEmissiveColor(true) gives true, then (false) gives false
WavefrontObjectLexer: FORWARD_SLASH and VERTEX_TEXTURE are different tokens: true
WavefrontObjectLexer: vt starts with VERTEX_TEXTURE: true, a slash in a face is FORWARD_SLASH: true
vt lines and f 1/2 2/3 3/1: texture coordinates 3, corners 3, texture indices 2 3 1
